{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And did not move.</b> It is missing the letter alef, like והיום רד מאד and מגזרת יחגרו ביזע. What seems correct to me is that it is from the doubled [root], like ביום שיזועו, in the sense of trembling and motion."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:01.276694592Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}